Run parameter for anasum
========================================================
Revision $Id: runparameter.dat,v 1.4.2.3.4.1.16.3.2.1.2.1 2008/12/10 20:06:34 gmaier Exp $
========================================================
All lines without a '*' in the first column are ignored!
--------------------------------------------------------

Time cuts
* TIMEMASKFILE timemask.dat
========================================================
Sky plot binning and size

binning of sky map (correlated plots) [deg]
* SKYMAPBINSIZE 0.01
binning of sky map (uncorrelated plots) [deg]
* SKYMAPBINSIZEUC 0.05
size of sky map (x-axis) [deg]
(preliminary: require same value for min and max)
* SKYMAPSIZEX -2.0 2.0
size of sky map (y-axis) [deg]
(preliminary: require same value for min and max)
* SKYMAPSIZEY -2.0 2.0
========================================================

========================================================
Star catalogue
* BRIGHTSTARCATALOGUE Hipparcos_MAG8_1997.dat
Minimum brightness of stars to be included
* BRIGHTSTARBRIGHTNESS 8.0
Radius of region to be excluded from background calculation around bright star (<=0 to switch off)
* BRIGHTSTAREXCLUDEFROMBACKGROUNDRADIUS 0.25

========================================================

Set centre position of sky map
(default: assume source coordinates)
in equatorial coordinates (ra,dec) (J2000, deg)
 SKYMAPCENTRE_RADECJ2000_DEG 306.74  44.3435
 in equatorial coordinates (ra,dec) (J2000, hours)
* SKYMAPCENTRE_RADECJ2000_HOUR 18 26 15.06 -14 50 54.2 

========================================================
Position where number of on and off events, significances,
effective areas, all 1D histograms, etc are calulcated
(default: at sky map centre)

relative to (0,0) in sky plot [deg]
(West,North)
 TARGETXYSHIFT 0. 0.
Position in equatorial coordinates (ra,dec) (J2000, deg)
 TARGETPOSITION_RADECJ2000_DEG 306.74  44.3435
Position in equatorial coordinates (ra,dec) (J2000, hours)
* TARGETPOSITION_RADECJ2000_HOUR 18 26 15.06 -14 50 54.2


========================================================

Regions in the sky to exclude from background 
->REGIONTOEXCLUDE (West(deg)  North(deg)  Radius(deg))
(coordinates are relative to camera center)
ex: 0.48 -0.2 0.5
Note: West positive means toward West (left in camera coordinates)
North positive means toward South (up in camera coordinates)
->REGIONTOEXCLUDE_RADECJ2000_DEG (RA(deg) DEC(deg) Radius(deg))
ex: 335.287 58.964 0.5
->REGIONTOEXCLUDE_RADECJ2000_HOUR (RA(Hour Min Sec)  DEC(Deg Min Sec)  Radius(deg))
ex:12 24 15 52 18 04 0.5
 REGIONTOEXCLUDE_RADECJ2000_HOUR 05 34 31.97 +22 00 52.1 0.4
 REGIONTOEXCLUDE_RADECJ2000_HOUR 05 32 31.97 +22 20 52.1 0.4

Default: exclude region around sky map centre
* REGIONTOEXCLUDE 0. 0. 0.40
Zeta Tau
* REGIONTOEXCLUDE_RADECJ2000_HOUR 14 27 00.392 +23 48 00.04 0.2

========================================================
Energy spectra 

Energy spectra binning (logarithmic axis)
* ENERGYBINSIZE 0.05
Minimum energy for power law fit to energy spectra (logarithmic value)
* ENERGYMINFIT -0.5;
Maximum energy for power law fit to energy spectra (logarithmic value)
* ENERGYMAXFIT 0.5;
Use effective areas vs MC or REC energy (set to 'MC' or 'REC')
* ENERGYEFFECTIVEAREAS REC
Energy reconstruction method 0 (default, s=s(r,E)) or 1 (E=E(s,r))
* ENERGYRECONSTRUCTIONMETHOD 1
Spectral index for effective areas
* ENERGYSPECTRALINDEX 4.0
Effective area smoothing, number of iterations
 ENERGYEFFAREASMOOTHITER 2
Effective area smoothing, smoothing threshold
 ENERGYEFFAREASMOOTHTHRESH 0.05
========================================================

========================================================
Rate plots

time intervalls for rate plots and short term histograms [minuts]
* RATEINTERVALLLENGTH 4.
